WEBVTT

00:00.930 --> 00:02.920
<i>(Isn't that maybe how love's defined?)</i>

00:02.920 --> 00:04.650
<i>Wow! A gift for you!</i>

00:04.650 --> 00:06.520
<i>(So, isn't that true love defined?)</i>

00:11.930 --> 00:13.710
<i>Nothing happening,</i>

00:13.710 --> 00:15.910
<i>every day feels the same</i>

00:15.910 --> 00:17.320
<i>Over and over, just</i>

00:17.320 --> 00:19.400
<i>waiting for time to pass</i>

00:19.400 --> 00:21.420
<i>When I'm with you,</i>

00:21.420 --> 00:22.620
<i>I can feel</i>

00:22.620 --> 00:24.750
<i>something so special,</i>

00:24.750 --> 00:27.880
<i>and I want to make it real</i>

00:27.880 --> 00:30.380
<i>Look, I'm really grateful every day, but you know</i>

00:30.380 --> 00:32.270
<i>I feel like I'm not doing enough in return</i>

00:32.270 --> 00:33.920
<i>"I was just feeling like it.</i>

00:33.920 --> 00:35.720
<i>No real meaning or reason why."</i>

00:35.720 --> 00:40.110
<i>Stop complaining and just take it already!</i>

00:39.080 --> 00:40.960
<i>(Isn't that maybe how love's defined?)</i>

00:40.960 --> 00:43.520
<i>Yeah, there's no way that's how it goes!</i>

00:42.680 --> 00:44.320
<i>(So, isn't that true love defined?)</i>

00:44.320 --> 00:46.360
<i>Whoa oh oh oh oh</i>

00:46.360 --> 00:48.810
<i>An angel just landed</i>

00:48.810 --> 00:50.700
<i>Right in front of me</i>

00:50.700 --> 00:52.320
<i>With a smile that looked</i>

00:52.320 --> 00:53.990
<i>Like her wings spreading open</i>

00:53.990 --> 00:55.950
<i>Hey, that's against all the rules</i>

00:55.950 --> 00:57.360
<i>You look so happy</i>

00:57.360 --> 00:59.290
<i>Wipe off that look</i>

00:59.290 --> 01:01.180
<i>Before my mind goes blank</i>

01:01.180 --> 01:03.020
<i>If you keep this up,</i>

01:03.020 --> 01:05.640
<i>You're gonna spoil me rotten</i>

01:06.460 --> 01:09.760
<i>Come on, you gotta do something about this</i>

01:08.220 --> 01:10.480
<i>So, let's get started</i>

01:10.480 --> 01:11.610
<i>I want to know</i>

01:11.610 --> 01:13.640
<i>A lot more about</i>

01:13.640 --> 01:15.680
<i>The world you live in</i>

01:15.680 --> 01:17.880
<i>So, let's get started</i>

01:17.880 --> 01:18.910
<i>I want to laugh</i>

01:18.910 --> 01:20.890
<i>A lot more with you</i>

01:20.890 --> 01:23.050
<i>In the world you live in</i>

01:22.350 --> 01:26.640
The Angel Next Door
Spoils Me Rotten

01:23.050 --> 01:25.020
<i>I want to know more</i>

01:25.020 --> 01:27.690
<i>I want to laugh more</i>

01:29.980 --> 01:34.990
First Shrine Visit (Hatsumode) with the Angel

01:36.200 --> 01:40.250
<i>And now, the temple bell 
to ring in the new year.</i>

01:49.240 --> 01:50.090
Huh?

01:50.820 --> 01:51.540
Oh.

01:52.390 --> 01:54.760
I wish you a happy New Year.

01:55.750 --> 01:57.560
Happy New Year.

01:58.820 --> 02:02.680
This feels really weird, 
spending New Year's together.

02:04.290 --> 02:05.690
I suppose it does.

02:06.160 --> 02:08.600
I hope we can continue 
our relationship this year.

02:08.960 --> 02:10.370
Me too.

02:10.370 --> 02:14.920
I mean, I feel like I'm the one 
who should be asking.

02:16.370 --> 02:18.570
I can't argue with that.

02:24.120 --> 02:26.480
I'm going to send a few replies.

02:26.480 --> 02:28.120
I should, too.

02:32.330 --> 02:37.340
<b>Today</b>

02:32.330 --> 02:37.340
<b>Having a cozy New Year's Eve with Shiina-san?</b>

02:33.650 --> 02:35.640
<i>Itsuki, you jerk.</i>

02:36.420 --> 02:37.340
<b>Shove it.</b>

02:37.170 --> 02:37.340
<b>Read</b>

02:46.020 --> 02:50.640
<b>Today</b>

02:46.020 --> 02:50.640
Mom

02:46.020 --> 02:50.640
<b>Happy New Year! Did you have a fun Eve with Mahiru-chan?</b>

02:46.610 --> 02:48.820
<i>Geez. Mom, too?</i>

02:49.600 --> 02:50.640
<b>No comment.</b>

02:50.060 --> 02:50.640
<b>Read</b>

02:52.730 --> 02:55.480
Dad

02:52.730 --> 02:55.480
<b>Happy New Year. I hope this turns out to be another good year for you.</b>

02:58.360 --> 03:00.860
Dad

02:58.360 --> 03:00.860
<b>By the way, mind if we visit your place day after tomorrow?</b>

03:02.990 --> 03:05.370
Dad

03:02.990 --> 03:05.370
<b>By the way, mind if we visit your place day after tomorrow?</b>

03:04.910 --> 03:05.370
<b>Read</b>

03:06.000 --> 03:07.450
The day after tomorrow...

03:13.800 --> 03:17.350
Hey. If you fall asleep here, 
you might catch a cold again.

03:21.970 --> 03:27.020
<i>Mahiru was busy all day today 
making food for the new year.</i>

03:30.970 --> 03:35.560
<i>She said she'd recovered from the cold, 
but it looks like she still overdid it.</i>

03:36.950 --> 03:40.240
<i>So I get why. I get it, but...</i>

03:42.070 --> 03:45.670
Mahiru, wake up. Mahiru!

03:52.910 --> 03:56.020
<i>Man, she smells so good!</i>

03:57.500 --> 03:59.080
<i>What should I do?!</i>

04:01.010 --> 04:03.970
<i>The only countermeasures 
I can think of are...</i>

04:04.280 --> 04:04.800
Boo!

04:04.800 --> 04:05.850
Wha—?!

04:05.850 --> 04:07.050
<i>Startle her awake.</i>

04:09.470 --> 04:14.520
<i>I don't think she'd take kindly to such a rude 
awakening when she's so tired already.</i>

04:15.310 --> 04:16.690
Shiina

04:15.800 --> 04:16.690
<i>Two:</i>

04:17.240 --> 04:18.690
<i>Take Mahiru back home.</i>

04:21.060 --> 04:23.760
<i>I can't fumble through 
a girl's clothes for a key</i>

04:23.760 --> 04:26.110
<i>and go into her room without permission!</i>

04:26.110 --> 04:28.200
<i>Not a chance.</i>

04:32.580 --> 04:33.460
<i>Three:</i>

04:33.930 --> 04:37.290
<i>Put her in my bed while I sleep on the couch.</i>

04:38.080 --> 04:41.820
<i>I think that's the best I can do. 
A good compromise.</i>

04:50.440 --> 04:51.670
Good night.

05:02.250 --> 05:05.400
<i>She's in for a real shock when she wakes up.</i>

05:09.350 --> 05:10.120
Huh?!

05:13.400 --> 05:15.400
She isn't even up yet!

05:28.260 --> 05:30.760
<i>She shouldn't drop her guard like this.</i>

05:31.310 --> 05:34.150
<i>Sure looks cute when sleeping, though.</i>

05:51.330 --> 05:52.230
Phew.

06:06.540 --> 06:07.420
Huh?

06:08.020 --> 06:09.050
M-Morning.

06:09.390 --> 06:11.680
Um, good... morning!

06:12.250 --> 06:15.600
You fell asleep at my place, 
so I let you sleep here.

06:15.600 --> 06:16.310
Nothing happened.

06:17.030 --> 06:20.180
In fact, you should thank me 
for doing absolutely nothing.

06:24.670 --> 06:26.940
<i>What is happening here?</i>

06:27.520 --> 06:31.050
Amane-kun, do you really like 
touching cheeks?

06:31.050 --> 06:31.720
Huh?

06:31.720 --> 06:36.410
You touched mine on Christmas 
and then before I fell asleep last night.

06:37.000 --> 06:38.800
You were awake the whole time?

06:38.800 --> 06:41.210
Huh? N-No, it's just...

06:41.210 --> 06:44.440
I woke up for a second 
when you put me in bed.

06:44.440 --> 06:48.220
What else could I do 
but pretend to be asleep?

06:48.590 --> 06:51.300
And you didn't stop to think 
I might try something?

06:51.300 --> 06:55.310
I didn't think <i>you</i> would, at least...

06:55.900 --> 07:00.310
I might have been pretending 
just to make sure you wouldn't.

07:00.800 --> 07:03.810
Well, I guess it's okay if it helps you trust me,

07:04.280 --> 07:07.920
but you can't do that again. 
I'm still a guy, you know.

07:07.920 --> 07:10.950
Uh... yes, I know that.

07:10.950 --> 07:13.240
Or did you <i>want</i> me to make a move?

07:14.620 --> 07:17.220
How could you even say that?!

07:18.600 --> 07:21.530
<i>Well, you </i>are<i> in my bed.</i>

07:27.810 --> 07:29.880
It's been half a year, Amane.

07:30.220 --> 07:32.110
Good to see you, Dad.

07:32.110 --> 07:35.800
You weren't that polite to your mom!

07:35.800 --> 07:38.740
Yeah, because you surprised me and barged in.

07:40.900 --> 07:42.440
What's the luggage for?

07:42.440 --> 07:44.970
We brought some things with us.

07:44.970 --> 07:47.290
But first, where's Mahiru-chan?

07:47.290 --> 07:47.940
Inside.

07:48.760 --> 07:51.110
Mahiru-chan, it's been so long!

07:51.480 --> 07:53.100
It's good to see you again.

07:53.100 --> 07:56.810
So long? It hasn't even been a month.

07:56.810 --> 07:58.790
Well, it felt like a long time to me.

08:00.480 --> 08:04.000
<i>Amane-kun's brother... no, father?</i>

08:04.400 --> 08:08.630
Nice to meet you. 
I'm Amane's father, Shuto Fujimiya.

08:09.230 --> 08:12.830
Shihoko-san told me 
all about you, Shiina-san.

08:12.830 --> 08:15.740
Thank you for looking after my son.

08:15.740 --> 08:19.150
Pleased to meet you. I'm Mahiru Shiina.

08:19.150 --> 08:22.480
Amane-kun has actually 
been a great help to me.

08:22.480 --> 08:26.090
Oh, dear. You don't need to be so modest.

08:26.090 --> 08:28.480
We know how much of a slob Amane is.

08:28.480 --> 08:31.130
Yeah, sorry for being a slob.

08:31.130 --> 08:34.600
Come on now, Shihoko-san. 
Don't say things like that.

08:34.600 --> 08:35.570
All right.

08:35.570 --> 08:36.460
Amane.

08:36.460 --> 08:37.390
Hmm?

08:37.390 --> 08:41.880
She always takes care of you, 
so I hope you show her some appreciation.

08:41.880 --> 08:43.410
Y-Yeah.

08:43.410 --> 08:47.420
Yes, Amane-kun 
is surprisingly very considerate.

08:47.420 --> 08:50.280
"Surprisingly"? 
What do you mean "surprisingly"?

08:50.280 --> 08:51.680
You know...

08:51.680 --> 08:54.880
I'm glad to see you both get along so well.

08:54.880 --> 08:59.320
Amane, you'd better not cause 
too much trouble for Shiina-san, okay?

08:59.920 --> 09:01.010
I know.

09:01.370 --> 09:06.020
And Shiina-san, if Amane ever acts badly,
 feel free to give him an earful.

09:06.480 --> 09:08.590
This kid is more cooperative than he looks,

09:08.590 --> 09:11.440
so I'm sure he'd improve any 
bad behavior you point out.

09:11.440 --> 09:15.320
Amane-kun is very kind to me. 
He doesn't behave badly.

09:15.320 --> 09:18.200
But he might have some flaws...

09:18.620 --> 09:21.660
<i>Like how he's always 
so cool without even trying.</i>

09:23.040 --> 09:23.990
Oh.

09:25.140 --> 09:26.710
Heh?

09:28.050 --> 09:29.670
<i>What was that for?</i>

09:31.110 --> 09:32.150
Here you go.

09:33.310 --> 09:36.970
Thank you so much, Mahiru-chan. 
You seem like you're used to things here.

09:36.970 --> 09:38.460
Y-Yes, I am.

09:39.050 --> 09:40.400
By the way, Amane.

09:40.400 --> 09:41.070
Hmm?

09:41.070 --> 09:44.430
You started calling 
Mahiru-chan by her first name, right?

09:45.260 --> 09:51.210
This is so nice. I'm tickled to see 
my son get along with such a pretty girl.

09:51.210 --> 09:54.830
Meanwhile I'm in a cold sweat, 
worried you'll slip back into old habits

09:54.830 --> 09:56.990
and start brutally teasing him.

09:56.990 --> 10:00.030
Oh, my. But wouldn't you stop me, Shuto-san?

10:00.360 --> 10:03.960
If you're aware that it's wrong, 
you should probably try to fix it.

10:03.960 --> 10:06.810
But I guess that quirk is one 
reason I fell for you, Shihoko-san.

10:06.810 --> 10:07.660
What can I say?

10:08.020 --> 10:10.290
Oh, Shuto-san, you!

10:11.890 --> 10:14.590
Your parents get along quite well.

10:14.590 --> 10:17.670
Yeah, they do. 
They're always like this at home.

10:19.030 --> 10:20.640
Is that right?

10:21.080 --> 10:24.810
Hey, kids. You haven't gone 
on your first shrine visit yet, have you?

10:24.810 --> 10:25.790
No.

10:25.790 --> 10:28.880
I thought so! That's why I brought a kimono!

10:31.230 --> 10:35.280
It's always been my dream to take 
my daughter on a shrine visit in a kimono,

10:35.680 --> 10:38.340
and I thought Mahiru-chan 
would look just gorgeous.

10:39.450 --> 10:43.480
Well, if Mahiru's okay with it, 
why not dress her up and take her?

10:43.480 --> 10:46.500
Oh? And why don't you think you're coming?

10:46.500 --> 10:51.080
Yeah, if the kids at school caught 
me out with Mahiru, it'd be a mess.

10:52.360 --> 10:53.960
So just don't get caught.

10:57.620 --> 11:00.300
Well, I guess it isn't awful.

11:00.730 --> 11:03.220
When you get dressed up
 without putting up a fuss,

11:03.220 --> 11:05.470
I think you look very handsome, Amane.

11:05.470 --> 11:08.200
That's a little too generous 
even for a parent.

11:08.200 --> 11:10.520
Itsuki was saying the same thing, though.

11:10.520 --> 11:13.150
Oh, that Itsuki-kun?

11:13.150 --> 11:17.390
He must be a really good kid 
if you vouch for him.

11:18.680 --> 11:22.160
Yeah, he's a good guy. 
Probably too good for me.

11:22.850 --> 11:24.910
Are you glad you came here, Amane?

11:30.440 --> 11:33.360
Yeah, I am. It's a lot easier.

11:33.360 --> 11:35.160
Good. I'm glad to hear it.

11:35.160 --> 11:36.500
Thanks for waiting!

11:40.760 --> 11:42.270
Well?

11:42.270 --> 11:46.140
Mahiru-chan is a great model, 
so it was a very rewarding process!

11:47.520 --> 11:49.890
Yes, you look very good in it.

11:49.890 --> 11:53.400
Come on, Amane. Tell her what you think.

11:54.020 --> 11:55.650
I th-think it looks good on you.

11:57.150 --> 11:59.530
You're really no good at this, are you?

12:02.030 --> 12:05.180
All right. Shuto-san, 
should we get the car ready?

12:05.180 --> 12:06.280
Yeah, let's do that.

12:07.800 --> 12:09.290
Thank you for waiting.

12:11.600 --> 12:13.300
Is something wrong?

12:13.960 --> 12:15.960
I just think it looks good on you.

12:16.930 --> 12:19.800
You really nail the 
"pure Japanese beauty" look.

12:20.280 --> 12:22.360
Cute and beautiful at the same time.

12:24.960 --> 12:28.090
Ah, I forgot how much you hate compliments.

12:28.090 --> 12:28.990
Sorry.

12:28.990 --> 12:31.930
N-No, that... isn't it.

12:32.350 --> 12:34.480
Amane-kun, you kind of look...

12:34.480 --> 12:35.460
Kind of look...?

12:40.430 --> 12:41.510
Amane-kun.

12:41.510 --> 12:42.110
Hmm?

12:42.110 --> 12:46.240
Um, I think you look really good, too.

12:52.080 --> 12:54.070
Now that's just unfair.

12:55.040 --> 12:59.960
The Angel Next Door
Spoils Me Rotten

12:59.960 --> 13:03.470
<b>Happy New Year</b>

13:06.470 --> 13:09.470
<b>Happy New Year</b>

13:06.470 --> 13:09.470
<b>Plague Begone</b>

13:06.470 --> 13:09.470
<b>Exit Route</b>

13:06.470 --> 13:09.470
<b>Exit Route</b>

13:06.470 --> 13:09.470
<b>Visit Shrine</b>

13:18.640 --> 13:20.380
Is something the matter?

13:23.490 --> 13:24.790
It's nothing.

13:25.320 --> 13:26.740
Are you sure?

13:31.400 --> 13:32.380
Are you okay?

13:32.380 --> 13:34.370
Yes. It's just the hem.

13:34.370 --> 13:35.660
But it isn't too—

13:38.760 --> 13:40.780
You sure don't look okay.

13:41.230 --> 13:42.510
I'm sorry.

13:42.510 --> 13:44.250
Come on. Give me your hand.

14:07.030 --> 14:09.530
<b>Exit Route</b>

14:12.440 --> 14:15.790
You were praying a long time. 
What did you ask for?

14:16.740 --> 14:18.420
Health and safety, I guess.

14:18.750 --> 14:21.040
A super conventional one.

14:21.040 --> 14:22.170
That and...

14:22.170 --> 14:23.000
That and?

14:23.910 --> 14:27.990
To keep on enjoying peaceful days like these.

14:28.460 --> 14:31.850
It sure isn't peaceful with my mom around.

14:28.840 --> 14:31.850
<b>Fortunes</b>

14:32.200 --> 14:35.020
That's fun in its own way, though.

14:35.020 --> 14:36.850
Are you sure about that?

14:37.920 --> 14:39.730
Hey, you two!

14:40.220 --> 14:41.730
Should we get going?

14:43.920 --> 14:44.810
Sure.

14:46.230 --> 14:48.490
<b>Sweet Sake & Red Bean Soup</b>

14:51.200 --> 14:54.410
<b>Sweet Sake & Red Bean Soup</b>

14:51.750 --> 14:53.260
How's the red bean soup?

14:53.260 --> 14:54.410
It's really good.

14:55.080 --> 14:56.380
Can I have a sip?

14:56.380 --> 14:57.240
Huh?!

14:57.240 --> 14:59.770
I-I guess so...

15:01.170 --> 15:03.000
It's fine if you don't want me to.

15:03.000 --> 15:04.820
It's not that.

15:04.820 --> 15:08.210
It's not that I don't want you to, but...

15:08.560 --> 15:09.420
But?

15:09.420 --> 15:12.390
N-No. It's fine. Here.

15:12.920 --> 15:14.810
And I'll have some sweet sake.

15:14.810 --> 15:16.260
S-Sure.

15:20.640 --> 15:21.860
<i>It's sweet.</i>

15:23.180 --> 15:25.230
What, don't you like the flavor?

15:25.230 --> 15:26.610
It's not that.

15:26.610 --> 15:29.650
Amane-kun, you were so conscious
 of this when we ate cake.

15:29.650 --> 15:31.990
So why aren't you now?

15:35.410 --> 15:39.600
S-Sorry! I spaced. You hated it, right?

15:35.410 --> 15:52.800
<b>Sweet Sake & Red Bean Soup</b>

15:39.600 --> 15:41.900
Why do you have to put it that way?

15:41.900 --> 15:45.150
I didn't hate it, but, well...

15:45.150 --> 15:47.360
It was just embarrassing.

15:47.360 --> 15:49.660
I'll be more careful. I'm sorry.

15:50.230 --> 15:52.800
I-I'm really not that worried about it!

15:53.130 --> 15:54.710
I'm still sorry.

15:55.300 --> 15:57.640
I shouldn't act the same way 
I do around the other two.

15:57.640 --> 15:59.470
Gimme a sip!

15:59.820 --> 16:00.650
Chitose!

16:00.650 --> 16:02.820
We're friends! It's fine, it's fine!

16:06.500 --> 16:10.240
Do you always do that sort of 
thing with Akazawa-san?

16:10.240 --> 16:12.910
Yeah, we're all friends.

16:12.910 --> 16:14.340
In that case...

16:18.020 --> 16:21.710
You and I are <i>close</i> friends, 
so I'm okay with it.

16:21.710 --> 16:23.590
O-Okay.

16:27.210 --> 16:29.760
I feel bad. You must be exhausted.

16:29.760 --> 16:33.370
No, I'm fine. I had a good time.

16:33.370 --> 16:34.220
Good.

16:34.220 --> 16:35.500
Also...

16:35.500 --> 16:36.470
Also?

16:37.410 --> 16:41.610
I feel like I got a taste of real happiness.

16:49.020 --> 16:51.100
E-Excuse me?

16:51.100 --> 16:52.250
It's nothing.

16:52.250 --> 16:56.070
This isn't nothing. You'll mess up my hair.

16:56.490 --> 16:57.700
So I can't?

16:58.120 --> 17:00.360
I'm not saying you can't,

17:00.360 --> 17:02.700
but at least warn me first.

17:02.700 --> 17:03.960
I'm touching.

17:03.960 --> 17:06.170
Not after the fact!

17:06.170 --> 17:07.240
Sorry.

17:08.740 --> 17:12.170
Oh, boy. This is all right with me,

17:12.820 --> 17:17.780
but you shouldn't pat most girls 
on the head so casually.

17:18.400 --> 17:20.560
Well, I wouldn't do it to anyone else.

17:22.290 --> 17:23.980
Huh? Oh.

17:23.980 --> 17:26.980
What? You wanted me to keep going?

17:27.880 --> 17:29.860
Please stop teasing me!

17:35.480 --> 17:37.420
<i>Maybe I overdid it.</i>

17:37.420 --> 17:38.730
A-Amane-kun.

17:40.290 --> 17:41.240
What is it?

17:41.240 --> 17:43.700
Amane-kun, you dummy!

17:47.430 --> 17:49.380
<i>Who's the real dummy, though?</i>

17:52.720 --> 17:54.800
Are you going back already?

17:55.240 --> 17:57.420
Yes, we don't have a choice.

17:57.420 --> 18:02.040
I would have loved to stay another 
day or two, but we have work.

18:02.040 --> 18:04.510
Well, we'll have another chance.

18:04.510 --> 18:07.770
However, I think next time is Amane's turn.

18:08.170 --> 18:11.150
I know, I know. I'll go visit in the summer.

18:11.530 --> 18:12.320
<i>Geez.</i>

18:12.800 --> 18:15.570
<i>They're pressuring me 
to bring Mahiru along, too.</i>

18:16.050 --> 18:19.820
As you can see, 
our Amane can be a little stubborn,

18:19.820 --> 18:23.200
but if you take a close look, 
he's a straightforward and gentle kid.

18:23.960 --> 18:26.490
I'd be thrilled if you'd continue 
your friendship with him.

18:26.490 --> 18:29.710
Do you have to say that now? 
I'm standing right here.

18:30.220 --> 18:34.840
I'm constantly reminded of what a kind 
and sincere person Amane-kun is.

18:35.230 --> 18:39.200
As for staying friends, that's 
something I'd even ask for myself.

18:39.200 --> 18:43.100
I'm glad to hear that. How reassuring.

18:43.100 --> 18:45.690
Yes, really! Isn't that nice, Amane?

18:45.690 --> 18:46.600
We'll visit again, okay?

18:46.600 --> 18:50.100
Fujimiya

18:47.720 --> 18:50.100
You don't need to 
flatter me in front of them.

18:50.410 --> 18:54.020
Do you think I'd flatter you 
with compliments I didn't mean?

18:54.480 --> 18:58.440
N-Not directly to me, but you 
might for my parents' sake.

18:59.320 --> 19:00.780
Please listen to me.

19:01.310 --> 19:06.110
I truly think you have a wonderful
 personality, Amane-kun.

19:06.110 --> 19:08.960
That's why I trust you enough 
to spend time with you like this.

19:09.440 --> 19:11.540
I didn't mean it as mere flattery.

19:11.540 --> 19:13.210
O-Oh.

19:13.840 --> 19:15.750
But it's all right as long as you understand.

19:16.280 --> 19:19.130
So, shall we start getting ready for lunch?

19:19.440 --> 19:21.720
<i>Trust, huh?</i>

19:23.140 --> 19:25.880
I'm so glad I moved here.

19:27.760 --> 19:29.230
Hey, hey, did you hear?

19:29.230 --> 19:32.760
There's a rumor that Shiina-san 
in class A has a boyfriend.

19:32.760 --> 19:34.210
I did, I did!

19:34.210 --> 19:37.650
They say she was holding hands 
with some boy on a shrine visit.

19:37.650 --> 19:40.880
Shiina-san didn't seem like 
she'd give anyone a shot,

19:40.880 --> 19:42.720
but maybe that was because 
she had a boyfriend.

19:42.720 --> 19:47.980
They said he looked really cool and 
they'd never seen him at school before.

19:47.980 --> 19:51.020
You think he's from another school, then?

19:51.990 --> 19:53.130
Hey, Amane.

19:53.130 --> 19:53.790
Don't care.

19:54.440 --> 19:56.040
I haven't said anything yet.

19:56.040 --> 19:57.500
Not my problem.

19:58.260 --> 19:59.440
Very well, sir.

19:59.440 --> 20:00.090
H-Hey!

20:00.810 --> 20:03.580
You try to hide it but you 
do have a nice face.

20:03.580 --> 20:07.100
Coming from you, 
it only sounds like you're teasing.

20:07.990 --> 20:10.230
You're always like this, man.

20:11.060 --> 20:11.980
Shut up.

20:12.960 --> 20:15.980
So our Shiina-san finally 
has a boyfriend, huh?

20:17.840 --> 20:20.260
They're talking about it all over school.

20:23.320 --> 20:28.090
It's good that nobody realized it was you, 
but it's quite a misunderstanding.

20:28.590 --> 20:31.190
It's going to be difficult to clear up.

20:31.790 --> 20:35.180
Is holding hands enough 
to make me your boyfriend?

20:35.180 --> 20:39.750
I wouldn't know. For now, I insisted 
that it was just an acquaintance.

20:40.880 --> 20:44.030
We just have to wait for the talk to die down.

20:44.030 --> 20:46.810
Yeah, I guess that's all we can do.

20:46.810 --> 20:48.010
Did we really...

20:48.010 --> 20:48.930
Hmm?

20:49.230 --> 20:51.560
look that much like a real couple?

20:51.900 --> 20:53.370
Who knows?

20:53.370 --> 20:58.380
But personally, I could never imagine 
a guy like me as your boyfriend.

20:58.380 --> 20:59.850
What do you mean "like you"?!

21:04.570 --> 21:08.830
I know you have a low opinion 
of yourself, but that isn't right!

21:09.310 --> 21:12.200
I think you're a really 
decent person, Amane-kun.

21:12.200 --> 21:16.300
You're kind, considerate, gentlemanly...

21:16.300 --> 21:19.530
and, um, I think you have a great personality.

21:20.120 --> 21:24.260
When you dress up, you look really good, too.

21:25.040 --> 21:26.900
R-Really?

21:27.530 --> 21:29.970
Um, thank you.

21:30.320 --> 21:33.240
So I mean, um, well...

21:33.240 --> 21:35.920
Don't be so hard on yourself!

21:35.920 --> 21:37.690
O-Okay...

21:39.780 --> 21:42.480
I'm... gonna wash the dishes!

21:42.480 --> 21:43.740
S-Sure!

21:55.260 --> 21:59.430
<i>If you're gonna get that embarrassed, 
why say it in the first place?</i>

23:34.930 --> 23:39.930
Next Time
